  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lovely Home for abandoned Cats</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stray cats often do not have proper shelter and are often forced to live on the streets, even experiencing violence. In this project, we want to build a safe and comfortable shelter for stray cats around the city. This shelter will serve as a place of refuge for cats, medical facility and play ground so they can be protected from harsh weather, predation, and other dangers that may occur outside.</narrative>
  </description>
